	docs/plan_context/zstd_runtime.md = Background moved from PLAN.md: zstd runtime design study and the open OpenBSD item
	examples/README.md = Worked examples: the Zig compiler and a Rust program as rocosmo containers, with recorded sizes/runs and caveats
