	examples/hello.zig = Proof-of-compile Zig program for the zig example: exits 145 = 12*12+1
	examples/rust_hello/src/main.rs = Proof-of-run Rust program for the rust example: prints 145 = 12*12+1
	flake.lock = Pinned flake inputs (nixpkgs, zstd sources)
	flake.nix = Pinned Roc nightly (and all-targets set), zstdz sources, Zig and test tools
