	probes/p2_native_targets/platform/Host.roc = Hosted function declarations (double!) the host implements
	probes/p2_native_targets/platform/main.roc = P2 platform header: entry points and per-target link inputs
	probes/p3_container/execve.c = Raw execve(2) launcher: runs a file with no shell ENOEXEC fallback (P3/P7 format tests)
	probes/p5_payload_layout/bcj.c = Invertible x86 CALL/JMP and arm64 BL/ADRP branch filter (BCJ) for delta experiments
	probes/p5_payload_layout/gen-roc-app = Generate a synthetic Roc app with N chained functions for size studies
	probes/p5_payload_layout/layout.awk = Exhaustive optimal choice of whole-frame roots vs zstd --patch-from deltas
	probes/p5_payload_layout/measure = Measure container size: gzip, zstd, solid and optimal depth-1 delta layout, with round-trip verification
	probes/p6_zstd_decoder/build = Cross-build the size-optimized zstd decoder and a no-decoder baseline per target
