	probes/p9_bsd_vms/run-in-vm = Boot a pinned, checksum-verified BSD image on a throwaway overlay and run guest.sh from a bundle tar disk
	scripts/build-pack-container = Cross-build rocosmo-pack for eight targets and pack it into one container
	scripts/build-roc-container = Pack the pinned Roc nightly for all five published systems into one container; --windows-launcher stores the Windows build compressed behind the launcher
	src/app_id.zig = App id: reverse-DNS validation, embedded marker scan, precedence and default
	src/ffi.zig = C ABI (pointer+length) over the packer core
	src/index.zig = Payload index wire format: encode, validating decode, rebuild plan
	src/launcher_desc.zig = Shared descriptor layout the packer patches and the launcher reads (index location, Windows entry name, hash, app id)
	src/layout.zig = Optimal depth-1 choice of whole zstd frames vs deltas (exhaustive)
