	src/zdec_small.c = One-TU wrapper of zstd's educational decoder: prefixed names, raw-prefix reference, exit redirected to rocosmo_zdec_fail
	src/zstd_decode.zig = Decode-only zstd wrapper used by the runtime
	src/zstd_encode.zig = zstd encoder: whole frames and --patch-from style deltas
	src/zstd_small.zig = Runtimes' zstd decoder: educational decoder via zdec_small.c plus XXH64 checksum check
	test = Complete test entry point: unit, docs, probes P2-P9, CLI and container suites
	tests/cli/arch_matrix.bash = Architecture matrix: pack exit-145 payloads for all 8 Linux CPUs into one zstd container; verify embedded==built runtime and full rebuild+exec under qemu-user per arch
	tests/cli/examples_compilers.bash = Offline mechanism check for the examples: packs dev-shell zig and a compiled rust_hello, verifies run and (for zig) compile from the container
	tests/cli/pack_container.bash = rocosmo-pack container: runs and packs identically on Linux, macOS, Windows
	tests/cli/roc_container.bash = Roc compiler container: runs and builds apps on Linux, macOS, Windows hosts
	tests/cli/rocosmo.bash = rocosmo command tests: Plan expects, CLI surface, universal and POSIX-only end-to-end
	tests/cli/toolchain_hosts.bash = Windows and macOS hosts build and pack P2 with only the Roc and rocosmo-pack containers
	tests/cli/windows_launcher.bash = Tests --windows-launcher: container shape, descriptor, byte-exact rebuild, and the Windows host Defender gate
	tests/docs.bash = Checks LICENSE is the MIT text and README links it
	tests/lib.bash = Shared assertions, capture, minimal PATH builder and remote run helpers
	tests/probes/p2_native_targets.bash = P2 checks: executable formats, OS-interface-only dependencies, native and remote runs
	tests/probes/p3_container.bash = P3 checks: rocosmo-pack joins P2's executables into one universal file that runs everywhere
	tests/probes/p4_build_hosts.bash = P4 check: a macOS build host reproduces the container byte for byte
	tests/probes/p5_payload_layout.bash = P5 tests: layout optimizer, round-trip verification, cache reuse, BCJ bijection
	tests/probes/p6_zstd_decoder.bash = P6 tests: per-target decoder builds, delta application, wrong-reference rejection
	tests/probes/p7_zstd_container.bash = P7: zstd layout end to end on Linux, qemu, macOS, Rosetta, Windows, WSL
	tests/probes/p9_bsd_vms.bash = P9: containers checked in FreeBSD, NetBSD and OpenBSD VMs (KVM x86_64, emulated aarch64), plus Roc's x64openbsd build
	tests/unit.bash = Runs the Zig unit tests of the packer core (zig build test)
]
